# Word counter
***
This project is a thing that allows you to view and add to diffrent documents while also tracking the document words count and last time acessed.

## How to use the word counter
***
1. Running the code will instantly bring you to the menu.
2. pick which doxument by pasting the file path.
3.Then go ahead and try the diffrent documents.

## List of Key Features
***
-Allows you to add to the document while also adding the word count and the time last accesed🤑

-Allows you to select the document you want! 🎉


